Package: ooarchive
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: ARCHIVE PACKER
 Deterministic reproducible archive builder guaranteeing byte-for-byte outputs.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 deterministic timestamp clamping, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
